                <span>📅</span> Season and Day Flexibility
              </span>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                A Friday, Sunday, or weekday date in the off-peak season, typically January through March, can lower venue and catering rates significantly.
              </p>
            </div>
